大梁称帝，912年在宫廷政变中被杀。", "status": "draft", "id": "0555e455-34d4-54ef-b93e-b0e6425018ab"}, {"name": "朱瑾", "aliases": [], "era": "晚唐", "birth_year": null, "death_year": null, "description": "《资治通鉴》卷256中和四年条所见人物：朱瑾。", "biography": null, "status": "draft", "id": "e4226d41-278e-53c7-9e01-7e3572231e8e"}, {"name": "陈儒（衢州刺史）", "aliases": [], "era": "晚唐", "birth_year": null, "death_year": null, "description": "《资治通鉴》卷260乾宁二年条所见人物：陈儒（衢州刺史）。", "biography": null, "status": "draft", "id": "78252860-401b-5e5f-944e-0df8feb5d989"}, {"name": "陈岌", "aliases": [], "era": "晚唐", "birth_year": null, "death_year": null, "description": "《资治通鉴》卷260乾宁二年条所见人物：陈岌。", "biography": null, "status": "draft", "id": "9fe13587-c86b-5f7f-9e00-803aecb36b46"}]'::jsonb)
